##   4.3   --- Fractured
###  4.3.1 ----- Exotic
Show
Class "Jewels" "Flasks"
FracturedItem True
    CustomAlertSound "homm3snd/Buildtwn.wav"
    MinimapIcon 0 Cyan Raindrop
    PlayEffect Cyan
###  4.3.2 ----- Global
Show
FracturedItem True
    CustomAlertSound "homm3snd/tailwind.wav"
    MinimapIcon 2 Cyan Raindrop
##   4.4   --- Synthesised
###  4.4.1 ----- Exotic
###  4.4.2 ----- Global
Show
SynthesisedItem True
    CustomAlertSound "homm3snd/VISIONS.wav"
    MinimapIcon 2 Cyan Raindrop
    PlayEffect Cyan Temp
    SetTextColor 128 216 192
