##   4.6   --- Elditch
###  4.6.1 ----- Exotic
Show
HasSearingExarchImplicit >= 5
    MinimapIcon 0 Red Cross
    PlayEffect Red
Show
HasEaterOfWorldsImplicit >= 5
    MinimapIcon 0 Red Cross
    PlayEffect Red
Show
HasSearingExarchImplicit >= 3
    MinimapIcon 1 Red Cross
    PlayEffect Red Temp
Show
HasEaterOfWorldsImplicit >= 3
    MinimapIcon 1 Red Cross
    PlayEffect Red Temp
###  4.6.2 ----- Global
Show
HasSearingExarchImplicit >= 1
    MinimapIcon 2 Red Cross
Show
HasEaterOfWorldsImplicit >= 1
    MinimapIcon 2 Red Cross
